# DSOM Current State

This file maintains a condensed, token-efficient representation of the project's current state. It is updated automatically by Semantic Compaction via the `.github/workflows/dsom-pr-sync.yml` workflow whenever a PR is closed.

## Active State
- DSOM framework initialized.
- Sovereign Engine and Security Policies defined.
- FastMCP tool suite (`tools/mcp/server.py`) integrated with `qmd_search` tool supporting hybrid, lexical, and vector on-device searches with explicit collection scoping (`-c <collection>`).
